      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229733/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel butternut squash with a vegetable peeler. Halve lengthwise; scoop out and discard seeds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BLqOfalnYNGbYDYGi3tpNVrG2O4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-229733-simple-roasted-butternut-squash-ddmfs-step-2-3828a15bb1c74800abf4ed142b69f59d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229733/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut halves into 1-inch cubes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q9eNRpjaosFOA72VCzalxjNQyg4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-229733-simple-roasted-butternut-squash-ddmfs-step-3-58289c3fbece4137bfe82e40c35646c7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229733/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine butternut squash cubes, oil, and garlic in a large bowl; toss to coat. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Qqz_QKCFhgw7c-og_BEI4BVW26k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-229733-simple-roasted-butternut-squash-ddmfs-step-4-10bf4a2b3d3f476b93bc421e1e4074d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229733/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange in a single layer on a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
